{title: Lagi Aaj Saawan Ki Phir Woh Jhadi Hai}
{artist: Chandni Suresh Wadkar}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Lagi aaj [C]sawan ki phir [D]woh jhadi hai
[C]Lagi aaj [Am]sawan ki phir [Em]woh jhadi hai
[Em]Wohi aag phir [C]seene mein phir [D]jal padi hai
[C]Lagi aaj [Am]sawan ki phir [Em]woh jhadi hai
[D]Kuchh aise hi din the [Am]woh jab hum mile the
[G]Chaman mein [D]nahi phool dil [Em]mein khile the
[Em]Wohi to [Am]hai mausam magar [Bm]rut nahin woh
[A]Mere saath [D]barsaat bhi [Em]ro padi hai
[D]Koi kash dil pe [Am]zara hath rakh de
[G]Mere dil ke [D]tukdon ko ek [Em]sath rakh de
[Em]Magar yeh [Am]hain khwabon [Bm]khyalon ki baatein
[A]Kabhi toot [D]kar cheez [Em]koi judi hai
